 "source_instruction": "i am looking for a hidden camera for surveillance. i want something hd with at least 1080p",
 "query": "I spent most of last weekend patching up the old wooden raised beds in my backyard, pulling out the last of the bolted arugula that went bitter in the early summer heat and mixing in a fresh layer of compost I picked up from the community garden drop-off. The neighborhood bunnies have been extra bold lately, too\u2014they chewed straight through the flimsy plastic netting I strung up around the lettuce starts last month, so I\u2019ve been leaving out little dishes of leftover carrot tops near the fence line to try to distract them from munching the new seedlings. I even hung a chipped ceramic birdhouse I found at a garage sale on the oak tree at the edge of the yard, and yesterday I spotted a pair of chickadees darting in and out of the entrance hole like they were checking it out for a potential nest spot. I\u2019ve heard video surveillance cameras that have 1440p HD resolution and motion detection work well for basic home use, and that options fitting that exact spec exist within a reasonable budget that works for basic home use, with no extra fancy add-ons beyond those core features I mentioned, no need to spend too much on units that go beyond those basics.",
